# Other AI clients' generated configs. This repo's own AI client is Claude Code
# (.claude/, CLAUDE.md, AGENTS.md are committed -- .claude/ is the source of
# truth for the shipped template DATs). Selecting a different Aiclient in Embody
# regenerates the configs below, so keep them out of git.
.cursor/
.windsurf/
.github/copilot-instructions.md
.github/instructions/
GEMINI.md

# Promotion
SUBMISSIONS.md

# User sandboxes
sandbox/
.release-drafts/

# TouchDesigner-generated (TDPyEnvManager, 2025.32280+)
dev/TDPyEnvManagerContext.yaml

# One-off diagnostic dumps from users -- don't commit other people's project data
tmp/

# Cloudflare Wrangler local state (web platform dev/deploy)
.wrangler/

# Marketing / promo assets -- not product code. Heavy ProRes renders (multi-GB),
# exported covers and overlays, the source promo networks (dev/marketing_lab),
# and one-off video probes. Keep these out of the product repo history; final
# deliverables live on disk (back them up elsewhere if you want versioning).
marketing/
dev/marketing_lab/
dev/_promo*

# Embody / Envoy (auto-managed)
.embody/*
!.embody/project.json
dev/embody/ext-diet-baseline/

# Convoy planning documents -- internal, not for publication (CONVOY_PLAN.md D-3)
dev/embody/CONVOY_*.md

# Agent isolation worktrees (git worktree add targets created by the
# Claude Agent tool). They are working copies of this same repo --
# committing one would nest the repo inside itself.
.claude/worktrees/

# Convoy prototype code -- internal until Convoy is announced (same rationale as D-3)
dev/convoy_tracer/
